{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022000208103-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022002831\"/><p>行動中拘捕一批女子。</p><p>旺角區警員聯同相關部門人員根據線報及深入調查後，昨日（21日）在區內展開代號「冠軍」的跨部門反非法入境者及非法勞工行動，突擊巡查區內多個地點。行動中，人員拘捕12名內地、1名泰國及1名菲律賓女子，年齡介乎18歲至37歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:40:40.475634+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:02:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:17:44.034309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:42.043047+00:00","content_hash":"6c91a310066faa1a06eba7670efbdd73945386ea853c70badc5aa06def727c38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}